<title>USA: NAL Financial stands by financial reports.</title>
<headline>NAL Financial stands by financial reports.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>NAL Financial Group Inc said on Thursday it stands by its financial statements and will vigorously defend itself against a purported class-action lawsuit alleging that NAL overstated its earnings.</p>
<p>The suit filed by the law firm of Lowey Dannenberg Bemporad &amp; Selinger also claims NAL misrepresented the adequacy of its underwriting guidelines and reserves for credit losses.</p>
<p>NAL said it has complied at all times with its disclosure obligations.</p>
<p>NAL is an automobile finance company with a special focus on consumers with non-prime credit. Its shares were trading at 2-1/2 at midday Thursday, unchanged on the day.</p>
